WRF ARW tescase: Hurricane Matthew

This is a test case that uses:
  (a) 1 domain (27km) over Caribbean
      Mercator projection
  (b) Simulation time period: 2016-10-06_00 to 2016-10-08_0
  (c) Default geographical data, NCEP GFS data

Reference:
https://www2.mmm.ucar.edu/wrf/OnLineTutorial/CASES/SST/index.php
